  phenomenal  if you've never seen them you need to  watch them up until injustice i was  never really disappointed by an animated  movie that they made there were some  questionable choices but by and large  they were just great right the dc  animated films i would say even rival  and in some ways exceed the marvel  cinematic universe but this  it was bad man it was just so  basic and formulaic and boring there was  no point when i was on the edge of my  seat there was no point when it was like  yes thank you like that's what i was  looking for no point when that was the  case it was just kind of like i mean you  know we didn't get to see yellow lantern  superman  [Laughter]  right super superman when he joins the  sinestro corps we never even got to see  that right it was just things like that  it was a hugely missed opportunity and  so having said all of that if you're a  person who never read the injustice  comics series i mean sure i guess you'll  like it but even you might find it just  kind of be like i mean it's pretty basic  and boring if you're a person who read  the injustice comic series it's gonna be  lacking in more than a few ways so with  that being said guys we're gonna bring  this to an end let me know down in the  comments section what you liked and what  you disliked about the injustice movie  thank you guys for watching and i will  catch you all later  peace
 

